{"version":1,"content":"<p>針對網上熱傳中國人工智能（AI）發展「重文娛、輕科研，方向已跑偏」，官媒《人民日報》今（20日）發表評論駁斥，強調中國始終致力於基礎研究和核心技術攻關，呼籲以長期眼光看待AI發展，毋須「崇洋媚外、妄自菲薄」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:04.754211+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:34:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T02:37:37.874944+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684299+00:00","content_hash":"1514ab91946d5a713fffcef5defcc52381e9229c19af393c1c33d97c32e8c4de","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}